--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party material
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository ships no Mojang data and no Mojang source code, in any
form (SPEC.md section 12). Vanilla worldgen definitions and conformance
fixtures are obtained by the user, at build/test time, from an official
jar the user downloads themselves; they are never redistributed here.

"Minecraft" is a trademark of Mojang AB. This project is not affiliated
with, endorsed by, or associated with Mojang AB or Microsoft.

Code adapted from third-party projects carries per-file attribution
naming the upstream file and its license. Expected upstreams:

  * cubiomes  — MIT License        — noise/biome math reference
  * Cuberite  — Apache License 2.0 — pipeline architecture reference

Any such adaptation must be recorded here and in the file header before
it merges.

