--------------------------------------------------------------------------

lib/src/blended.cpp is adapted from cubiomes by Cubitect
(https://github.com/Cubitect/cubiomes): the octave loop and blend of
`sampleSurfaceNoise` in biomenoise.c, and the octave seeding order of
`octaveInit` in noise.c. cubiomes is MIT-licensed:

